      "source_historical_star_group": "TianJi",
      "original_line_number": 3,
      "source_original_exact_Chinese_Wikitext_quote": "天机襁褓多灾，陷地头面破相，巨门同血气疾，天梁同下部疾，太阴同疮灾，加羊火陷宫有目疾，四肢无力。",
      "source_quote_SHA256": "b7b31930f4bdf4b4381114c15b2fb813e254ff3c70545b120c864378ad623365",
