      "source_historical_star_group": "TaiYang",
      "original_line_number": 4,
      "source_original_exact_Chinese_Wikitext_quote": "太阳头风，太阴同加化忌，羊陀主眼目有伤，陷宫亦主目疾欠光明。",
      "source_quote_SHA256": "2fc3be0707d06c3e5162e7fadd20064bf755509d3c5bfe2df5557c23c2e335a3",
